  subtitles:
  - text: "Oh god... the smell. You can\u2019t smell it on the tape, but it\u2019s...
      it\u2019s like meat."
    duration: 7.5
  - text: "Rotting meat. It\u2019s coming from the spare suits."
    duration: 4.5
  - text: "I looked inside one of them. There\u2019s... there\u2019s hair. And...
      fluids."
    duration: 8.5
  - text: This isn't oil. This is blood.
    duration: 3.5
  - text: What was that? It came from the <b><color=yellow>Carousel</color></b>.
    duration: 4
  - text: I have to go look. I have to know what's moving out there.
    duration: 5
